  "details": "14689 `Choose movement style and tunneling to reduce motion sickness.`\n\nThis string appears on `MM > Settings > Comfort & Safety > Comfort > Locomotion Tunneling` It is shown only when \"Holoport Locomotion\" is off. Under this item, you can select only tunneling effect options.\n\nSo, you should remove the \"movement style\" part and rephrase it as a whole.\n\n- I guess the \"movement style\" means using the Holoport or not. And this string might be correct with an old menu design in the past. But I'm not sure.\n\n- I've posted an identical issue on Crowdin before. Please resolve it when this post is resolved.",
